; flag becomes true at the entry of the payment. The prefix up to the payment
; has two readings for the second term: the obligation completed before the
; guard fires (Done, by an executed action), and the guard interrupting it,
; with the handler bob MUST_NOT leak reached (Interrupted). One reading has
; reached a prohibition, so the status is conservative and stays OPEN
; (formal/core/CORE.md, decision 34). The other terms also reach a prohibition
; when Alice pays and stay OPEN while nothing violates it.
(scenario readings_guard_at_pay
  (spec "examples/core/core_readings.triel")
  (entry "2026-06-01T00:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data (flag (bool false))))
  (entry "2026-06-01T01:00:00Z" (act alice pay must)
    (data (flag (bool true)))))
